    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21987" root="شذو" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَذَا</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَذُوَ</span></b> : see 4. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>He perfumed
himself</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَطَيَّبَ</span>) <i>with musk,</i> (K, TA,) which is
termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَذْوٌ</span>, or, as in copies of the M, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِذْوٌ</span>. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَذَا بِالخَبَرِ</span>, (K, TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَذْوٌ</span>;
or, accord. to the Tekmileh, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بالخبر</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شذّى</span></b> , there
written with teshdeed; (TA;) (tropical:)  <i>He knew the
information,</i> or <i>story, and made it known,</i> or
<i>understood.</i> (K, TA.)

